      "answer": "To scaffold a new Playwright project, you can use one of the following commands depending on the package manager you are using:\n\n- **npm**:\n  ```bash\n  npm init playwright@latest\n  ```\n\n- **yarn**:\n  ```bash\n  yarn create playwright\n  ```\n\n- **pnpm**:\n  ```bash\n  pnpm create playwright\n  ```\n\nAfter running the command, you will be prompted to choose options such as TypeScript or JavaScript, the tests folder name, whether to add a GitHub Actions workflow, and whether to install Playwright browsers. [doc-05#0003]",
