      "answer": "Element conditions that could block a click include being invisible, disabled, or not stable. To step through the test and see what happens, use the Playwright Inspector, which allows you to play, pause, or step through each action of your test. This lets you see the current action highlighted in the test code and matching elements highlighted in the browser window. [doc-04#0016]",
